// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3348783157" "Aeon's story is a strange one. We will have to follow up on this 'Professor Echo' he mentions. He sounds as though he is particularly interested in your future, and he could be a threat to Operation DESTINY."
// RandomFameString :
"P2104023614" "Did you see {VillainName} in Aeon City the other day?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P111581398" "Dr. Aeon mentioned a Professor Echo who hinted at your future. But rather than send you off to catch some old fool, we have our own means of determining these things. I know that Lord Recluse often consults with both my Fortunata seers and Scirocco's Mu Mystics to find glimpses of the future. I want you to go to the Mu Mystic prognostication group, and confirm this strange tale with their leader, Mu'Kau. They won't be happy to see you, but any mayhem you cause while looking for Mu'Kau will only ensure that he tells you the truth when you do find him."
// AcceptString :
"P2593166186" "Go to Arachnos center for prognostication"
// SendOffString :
"P1267603598" "Oh, Scirocco will no doubt be upset when he hears of the damage you caused, but I can calm him. And besides, if they did not see it coming, they can't be terribly good at seeing the future, now can they? You have my permission to use any force necessary to wring the truth from those you encounter."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1357210211" "Learn your future"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2654123504" "I want to know what Professor Echo's message means."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2420264883" "This place is filled with Mu Mystics floating about in their strange way."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4281658525" "Concentrate. The future will become clear."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4022299677" "I see the Destined One, destroying an... An Arachnos base!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3318631205" "The visions are true!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3870206853" "Defeat the false 'Destined One'!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P520959605" "Mystic Mu'Kau"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3434565800" "I can already see how this is going to end."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2635422154" "I hate being right."

