"P264712602" "So, it was as the mystics said. You destroyed the world, {VillainName}. Or rather, you will destroy it, unless you die or Operation: DESTINY is stopped."
// RandomFameString :
"P1659710963" "{VillainName} really scares me sometimes. Is there anything that one's not capable of?"

